          "href": "https://roundrockisd.schoology.com/assignment/8081286159",
          "assignmentDetails": {
            "score": "100/100",
            "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Whole book, theme based writing.</p>\n<p>Themes to track:</p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>Faith and meaning</li>\n<li>Survival</li>\n<li>Truth and storytelling</li>\n<li>Human/animal relationships</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:1em;margin-left:0px;padding:0px;line-height:1.4;\" dir=\"ltr\">On a piece of white paper, create a one-page response to Life of Pi in which you examine a thematic element of the novel.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px;padding:0px;line-height:1.4;\" dir=\"ltr\">On the front, include:</p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li style=\"margin:0px;\">Title, Author 10</li>\n<li style=\"margin:0px;\">Theme word 5</li>\n<li style=\"margin:0px;\">Thematic statement (GET THIS CHECKED!) 20</li>\n<li style=\"margin:0px;\">Two pieces of text evidence from the book that underscore your theme and thematic statement. These must be 50 or more pages apart. Include page numbers. 20</li>\n<li style=\"margin:0px;\">Full color illustration 20</li>\n<li style=\"margin:0px;\">Decorative or thematic border 10</li>\n<li style=\"margin:0px;\">rating out of five stars 5</li>\n<li style=\"margin:0px;\">FULL COLOR PAGE</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px;padding:0px;line-height:1.4;\">On the back, write:</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"margin:0px;\">Your name &amp;&nbsp;class period 10</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px 0px;padding:0px;line-height:1.4;\">The assignment is due by the end of class, so budget your time wisely.</p>",
